WEBVTT

00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:08.650
Wait up!

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:19.870
An eclipse?

00:00:22.350 --> 00:00:24.740
An eclipse in LINK VRAINS?

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:26.480
Is this an event?

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:28.800
No official event was announced.

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:30.780
Is it a bug?

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:35.410
What’s going on?

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:37.150
Who created this program?

00:00:37.150 --> 00:00:39.210
Is it a bug?  Or a virus?

00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:41.190
Deal with this immediately!

00:00:41.190 --> 00:00:43.090
Or you’re fired!

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:48.310
What's going on?

00:00:48.310 --> 00:00:51.240
Did the Knights of Hanoi do this?

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:54.330
Or is it a new threat?

00:00:54.330 --> 00:01:00.330
Ancient people were scared, thinking 
eclipses were signs of cataclysms.

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:03.340
But people today are still scared?

00:01:03.340 --> 00:01:05.000
More than you think.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:10.340
Even if technology advances, 
people haven't really changed.

00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:12.460
Really?

00:01:13.270 --> 00:01:16.420
The light is hidden by darkness.

00:01:16.420 --> 00:01:18.120
Say what?

00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:20.400
You mean the Lost Incident?

00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:21.290
Yeah.

00:01:21.290 --> 00:01:25.670
But I won’t let the 
darkness bury that incident.

00:01:25.670 --> 00:01:30.040
I promise to bring the truth to light!

00:01:52.610 --> 00:01:55.730
I run Across the universe

00:01:55.880 --> 00:01:58.900
At the speed of light

00:01:59.310 --> 00:02:00.770
Begin Loading

00:02:01.010 --> 00:02:04.500
Open the door of dreams

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:08.070
VRAINS spreads

00:02:08.320 --> 00:02:11.180
Believe in myself

00:02:11.420 --> 00:02:14.710
VRAINS continues

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:20.020
The circuit draws the future

00:02:20.300 --> 00:02:24.090
I'll grab it with my own hands  Yeah

00:02:24.470 --> 00:02:25.690
Access!

00:02:25.770 --> 00:02:28.390
Start swirling, Data Storm!

00:02:28.670 --> 00:02:30.000
I'm now With the Wind

00:02:30.180 --> 00:02:32.300
Link with my soul

00:02:32.410 --> 00:02:35.070
Speed up, Data Storm!

00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:36.800
Now Win the Race

00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:39.640
Connected world

00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:43.140
No matter when

00:02:43.390 --> 00:02:46.510
Nothing is impossible

00:02:46.730 --> 00:02:50.650
Strive for hope

00:02:50.860 --> 00:02:55.220
And ride the wind!

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:13.770
You…  Hey, you.

00:03:14.280 --> 00:03:15.870
Who is it?

00:03:19.230 --> 00:03:21.000
Who is it?

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:21.800
You.

00:03:23.250 --> 00:03:27.020
Who is it?  Where are you?

00:03:27.020 --> 00:03:30.420
Show yourself.  Please!

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:39.160
Stop daydreaming!

00:03:39.160 --> 00:03:41.160
Class is over!

00:03:41.170 --> 00:03:44.170
I thought you turned into an Athnoer.

00:03:44.170 --> 00:03:45.210
Athnoer?

00:03:45.210 --> 00:03:48.320
You don’t know about Athnoers?

00:03:48.320 --> 00:03:51.590
You're hopeless.

00:03:51.590 --> 00:03:57.390
Since people like you don't know what's up, 
you need people like me to provide the info.

00:03:57.390 --> 00:04:01.360
Oh well.  I do it for the good of society.

00:04:01.360 --> 00:04:04.280
Hey!  Wait up!

00:04:04.280 --> 00:04:07.040
So an Athnoer is…

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:08.760
Are you listening?

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:14.770
Athnoers are people who went to 
LINK VRAINS and haven’t returned.

00:04:14.770 --> 00:04:18.310
More people are absent from school, right?

00:04:18.310 --> 00:04:21.240
They’ve probably become Athnoers.

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:25.480
It's all due to a cursed Duel Disk!

00:04:25.480 --> 00:04:26.960
Cursed Duel Disk?

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:31.490
You don’t know about that either?  Sheesh!

00:04:31.490 --> 00:04:38.590
Exactly at midnight, white hands 
come out of a cursed Duel Disk.

00:04:41.630 --> 00:04:50.170
The white hands drag the Duel 
Disk’s owner into LINK VRAINS.

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:56.290
The body is an empty shell.

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:59.000
A living corpse.

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:01.900
They’re taken to the hospital’s ICU.

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:06.760
Once you become Athnoer, you 
may never wake up again.

00:05:06.760 --> 00:05:09.320
Isn’t that similar to Blue Angel?

00:05:09.320 --> 00:05:10.560
Talk later!

00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:11.840
Say something?

00:05:11.840 --> 00:05:13.720
No, nothing.

00:05:14.130 --> 00:05:16.180
You’re lucky.

00:05:16.180 --> 00:05:20.760
The Duel Disk only targets 
duelists with a promising future.

00:05:20.760 --> 00:05:24.560
I’m nervous because I know it's after me!

00:05:24.560 --> 00:05:28.170
Then stay away from your Duel Disk.

00:05:28.170 --> 00:05:36.520
I wish Playmaker - the duelist of 
justice - would show up and end this.

00:05:38.610 --> 00:05:41.680
Oh, let me correct one thing.

00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:44.360
It’s not "Athnoer."  It’s "Another."

00:05:46.460 --> 00:05:48.800
Another, as in "another" world.

00:05:49.260 --> 00:05:52.690
Thanks for the info, Info Man.

00:05:53.320 --> 00:05:54.670
What’s with that!

00:05:54.670 --> 00:05:58.700
You kept me talking, but you 
knew everything already!

00:05:58.700 --> 00:06:01.940
How dare you make fun of me!

00:06:05.490 --> 00:06:09.520
I hacked the convenience 
store’s security camera.

00:06:09.520 --> 00:06:10.950
What's so special?

00:06:10.950 --> 00:06:13.920
It shows a person turning into Another.

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:17.160
This is worth checking out.

00:06:20.250 --> 00:06:22.700
Six minutes until midnight.

00:06:22.700 --> 00:06:24.690
Press fast forward.

00:06:24.690 --> 00:06:26.400
No, leave it be.

00:06:27.570 --> 00:06:29.200
It’s starting.

00:06:31.730 --> 00:06:35.690
What?  Midnight is a lie?

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:40.850
What’s going on?  It's hard to see.

00:06:40.850 --> 00:06:42.640
And no white hands.

00:06:42.640 --> 00:06:48.120
He accessed LINK VRAINS, but not by choice.

00:06:52.370 --> 00:06:53.860
So this is Another...

00:06:54.300 --> 00:06:57.920
He was immediately taken to the hospital.

00:06:57.920 --> 00:07:01.160
But he hasn’t regained consciousness.

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:06.980
That hospital has an ICU specifically 
for Another patients.

00:07:08.950 --> 00:07:11.100
This symptom is…

00:07:11.100 --> 00:07:12.050
Yeah.

00:07:15.940 --> 00:07:19.480
At first, people thought Anothers decided to

00:07:19.480 --> 00:07:23.550
abandon the real world and chose to live in LINK VRAINS.

00:07:24.020 --> 00:07:26.320
But that doesn’t seem true.

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:33.990
I believe someone is stealing their 
souls, turning them into empty shells.

00:07:35.330 --> 00:07:37.130
But who?  And why?

00:07:38.380 --> 00:07:43.640
What happened to Anothers' avatars 
when they went to LINK VRAINS?

00:07:43.640 --> 00:07:46.320
We need to investigate that too.

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:49.910
But for now, I gathered data on Anothers.

00:07:54.590 --> 00:07:59.820
This data shows Anothers 
have three common traits.

00:07:59.820 --> 00:08:03.440
#1: They have exceptional dueling talent.

00:08:03.440 --> 00:08:06.700
#2: They use the old-type Duel Disk.

00:08:06.700 --> 00:08:09.560
#3: They're all hackers.

00:08:09.560 --> 00:08:12.800
We can draw the conclusion that…

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:15.390
Playmaker is the target?

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:19.590
Or the Ignis that's with Playmaker.

00:08:19.590 --> 00:08:20.920
Meaning you.

00:08:20.920 --> 00:08:23.340
Tough to be popular, right Yusaku?

00:08:23.340 --> 00:08:24.680
Don’t group us together.

00:08:24.680 --> 00:08:27.070
That means the culprit is…

00:08:27.070 --> 00:08:29.970
No, it’s too early to decide.

00:08:30.600 --> 00:08:32.120
What should we do?

00:08:33.330 --> 00:08:38.080
Just when we found a lead to uncovering 
the truth about the Lost Incident.

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:40.520
We will uncover the truth.

00:08:40.520 --> 00:08:45.370
And we will get revenge on those who 
stole my and your brother’s past.

00:08:45.700 --> 00:08:46.480
However…

00:08:46.480 --> 00:08:49.770
We can’t let any more 
people become Anothers!

00:08:49.770 --> 00:08:53.420
You’re so cool, hero of justice!

00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:55.160
That wasn't necessary.

00:08:55.160 --> 00:08:55.710
Right.

00:08:55.710 --> 00:09:00.580
I knew you'd say that, so I 
made a list of likely targets.

00:09:01.540 --> 00:09:03.600
He's first.

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:06.150
Makoto Kimishima, 16 years old.

00:09:06.150 --> 00:09:09.020
Yusaku, he goes to your high school.

00:09:10.640 --> 00:09:14.260
Makoto Kimishima lives here?

00:09:14.260 --> 00:09:16.680
Top floor on the left.

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:33.650
Hey!  Pull yourself together!

00:09:33.650 --> 00:09:35.550
Yusaku!  Over there!

00:09:40.400 --> 00:09:44.220
Is that Makoto Kimishima’s 
avatar inside LINK VRAINS?

00:09:44.220 --> 00:09:45.970
Who's the other guy?

00:09:46.510 --> 00:09:48.460
This is your final chance.

00:09:48.460 --> 00:09:50.680
Are you Playmaker?

00:09:50.680 --> 00:09:54.130
How many times do I have 
to tell you?  I’m not!

00:09:56.910 --> 00:09:59.350
I have one more question.

00:09:59.350 --> 00:10:01.880
Is your AI an Ignis?

00:10:01.880 --> 00:10:04.020
I don't have an AI!

00:10:04.020 --> 00:10:05.780
I thought so.

00:10:05.780 --> 00:10:07.920
That’s what everyone says.

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:12.880
Oh well.  I'll have you sleep here.

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:14.530
Good night.

00:10:22.670 --> 00:10:24.580
Makoto!

00:10:26.150 --> 00:10:27.260
That’s…

00:10:27.260 --> 00:10:28.250
Go Onizuka!

00:10:38.890 --> 00:10:41.850
Makoto, open your eyes.

00:10:43.310 --> 00:10:44.620
Makoto…

00:10:46.030 --> 00:10:49.470
I was wondering who it was.

00:10:49.470 --> 00:10:53.190
You’re the charisma duelist Go Onizuka.

00:10:53.190 --> 00:10:57.950
But you're no longer in the 
Top 50 most popular duelists.

00:10:57.950 --> 00:11:00.680
Be quiet!  What did you do to Makoto?

00:11:00.680 --> 00:11:04.050
I put a computer virus into him.

00:11:04.050 --> 00:11:05.610
What?

00:11:05.610 --> 00:11:07.650
Heal Makoto right now!

00:11:07.650 --> 00:11:12.120
Then join the hunt for Playmaker.

00:11:12.120 --> 00:11:13.820
Hunt Playmaker?

00:11:15.030 --> 00:11:22.860
If you give Playmaker to us, the Knights of 
Hanoi, we will give you this virus removal program.

00:11:23.170 --> 00:11:24.830
Knights of Hanoi?

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:27.810
I won’t be your lackey!

00:11:28.170 --> 00:11:29.900
I see.

00:11:29.900 --> 00:11:34.540
Then I’ll leave him as is, 
just like the other victims.

00:11:34.940 --> 00:11:37.640
How dare you!  What’s your name?

00:11:38.050 --> 00:11:40.890
My name is Dr. Genome!

00:11:40.890 --> 00:11:43.590
If you see Playmaker, tell him this!

00:11:43.590 --> 00:11:50.560
If he doesn’t want any more Another 
victims, then appear before me immediately.

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:54.930
He's an expert at tickling 
your sense of justice.

00:11:55.310 --> 00:11:58.930
Contact me if you change your mind.

00:11:58.930 --> 00:12:02.920
I hope you respond favorably.  See you.

00:12:06.190 --> 00:12:10.510
It's now clear that the Knights 
of Hanoi create Anothers.

00:12:10.510 --> 00:12:14.280
And their target is me!

00:12:18.400 --> 00:12:23.420
If Hanoi’s program activates, the 
Lost Incident's records will be erased.

00:12:23.420 --> 00:12:26.920
And I'll never know Playmaker's identity.

00:12:29.520 --> 00:12:32.310
The plan is coming together.

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:35.030
So Hanoi’s program will…

00:12:35.030 --> 00:12:38.040
Soon be complete.  And then…

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:39.450
Yes.

00:12:40.010 --> 00:12:43.010
What’s wrong?  What’s with the long face?

00:12:43.010 --> 00:12:45.020
I want a little time.

00:12:45.020 --> 00:12:47.480
Time?  For what?

00:12:47.480 --> 00:12:49.930
I want to settle things with someone.

00:12:49.930 --> 00:12:51.800
You mean Playmaker.

00:12:57.960 --> 00:13:01.330
I can’t move on if I still lost to him.

00:13:01.330 --> 00:13:04.940
I see.  But I can’t wait for long.

00:13:04.940 --> 00:13:05.890
Understood.

00:13:14.460 --> 00:13:16.300
How's Makoto doing?

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:19.260
He still hasn’t woken up.

00:13:19.640 --> 00:13:21.250
I see.

00:13:21.250 --> 00:13:22.930
Did you bring him here?

00:13:22.930 --> 00:13:28.260
No.  By the time I got to his room, 
the paramedics were already there.

00:13:28.260 --> 00:13:30.590
I don’t know who called them.

00:13:30.590 --> 00:13:34.210
You and Makoto were in the same orphanage.

00:13:34.210 --> 00:13:39.740
Yeah.  When we were kids, Makoto 
was a weakling who was bullied.

00:13:40.560 --> 00:13:43.850
I always protected him.

00:13:46.200 --> 00:13:50.820
Before I was placed in the orphanage, 
I only relied on myself.

00:13:50.820 --> 00:13:53.620
My world was survival of the fittest.

00:13:53.620 --> 00:13:58.620
"You must protect yourself" was my credo.

00:13:58.620 --> 00:14:03.890
But Makoto didn't live in my world.

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:09.920
He was kind.

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:19.950
We were complete opposites, 
but we hit it off.

00:14:26.030 --> 00:14:30.120
It’s my fault that Makoto 
is in this condition.

00:14:30.580 --> 00:14:36.810
Makoto started dueling when you 
began making your name as a duelist.

00:14:37.530 --> 00:14:44.330
And he stood out, even winning 
the district tournament.

00:14:44.330 --> 00:14:47.070
I should have stopped him then.

00:14:47.070 --> 00:14:50.940
No, you couldn't have 
stopped him from dueling.

00:14:50.940 --> 00:14:53.520
Do you think you can easily stop?

00:14:55.410 --> 00:14:57.980
So it’s not your fault.

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:00.860
Makoto!

00:15:05.100 --> 00:15:07.330
Doctor!  How’s Makoto?

00:15:07.330 --> 00:15:10.640
We've done everything, but 
he still won't wake up.

00:15:10.640 --> 00:15:14.200
He has the same symptoms 
as the other Anothers.

00:15:14.200 --> 00:15:18.080
Another?  So he’ll be like this forever?

00:15:18.080 --> 00:15:19.810
We'll do our best.

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:22.100
That's all I can say.

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:23.200
Excuse me.

00:15:26.880 --> 00:15:28.710
This is serious.

00:15:29.220 --> 00:15:31.940
I will save Makoto.

00:15:31.940 --> 00:15:35.760
So I must defeat Dr. Genome!

00:15:42.510 --> 00:15:43.600
Wait!

00:15:45.320 --> 00:15:47.070
What are you doing here?

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:50.040
Makoto wears the same school uniform.

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:52.220
You came because you were worried?

00:15:52.220 --> 00:15:54.640
Yeah.  Something like that.

00:15:54.920 --> 00:15:55.880
What’s your name?

00:15:56.740 --> 00:15:57.980
Fujiki.

00:15:59.760 --> 00:16:01.280
Yusaku Fujiki.

00:16:06.380 --> 00:16:09.840
- C'mon!
- Let’s duel!

00:16:09.840 --> 00:16:10.630
No way!

00:16:10.630 --> 00:16:13.630
We'll never duel the Hanoi!

00:16:13.630 --> 00:16:14.960
Log out!

00:16:14.960 --> 00:16:16.590
I won’t let you!

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:26.080
- We’re forcing you to duel!
- Let’s have fun!

00:16:29.940 --> 00:16:37.280
Over a thousand people have joined the 
Knights of Hanoi, but they’re mostly hoodlums.

00:16:37.280 --> 00:16:42.420
They're only infatuated with 
Hanoi for opposing LINK VRAINS.

00:16:42.420 --> 00:16:45.820
They're only it for self-promotion.

00:16:46.300 --> 00:16:50.650
They tarnish the Knights 
of Hanoi’s reputation.

00:16:51.170 --> 00:16:52.630
You came.

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:56.360
Now is the time to carry 
out Dr. Kogami’s wishes.

00:16:56.780 --> 00:17:00.330
Our mission is to kill the Ignis.

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:03.340
Dr. Genome is already making his move.

00:17:03.340 --> 00:17:06.570
We gave him the Data Gale.

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:08.500
Thanks for waiting.

00:17:08.500 --> 00:17:10.030
Thanks again!

00:17:12.630 --> 00:17:13.640
You’re going?

00:17:13.640 --> 00:17:14.710
Yeah.

00:17:14.710 --> 00:17:16.160
Look at that.

00:17:16.880 --> 00:17:19.620
Hack Worm attacks you directly!

00:17:20.070 --> 00:17:24.100
The Knights of Hanoi are 
running wild in LINK VRAINS.

00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:25.990
Their target is Playmaker.

00:17:25.990 --> 00:17:32.600
But they're indiscriminately dueling 
everyone, turning losers into Anothers.

00:17:32.600 --> 00:17:34.660
That’s why I need to go.

00:17:34.660 --> 00:17:39.530
I don’t think they'll duel you 
fairly.  It’s too dangerous.

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:42.880
That’s right.  A wise man 
stays away from danger.

00:17:42.880 --> 00:17:45.240
I can't ignore this.

00:17:45.240 --> 00:17:49.680
It’s fine to be a hero, but 
our fates are intertwined.

00:17:49.680 --> 00:17:52.830
So when you act, think of my safety too.

00:17:52.830 --> 00:17:53.920
Be quiet.

00:17:56.530 --> 00:17:58.460
Go, Playmaker!

00:17:58.460 --> 00:17:59.690
I was waiting for you!

00:17:59.690 --> 00:18:00.790
Good luck!

00:18:00.790 --> 00:18:03.320
Defeat the Knights of Hanoi!

00:18:03.320 --> 00:18:05.770
I’m counting on you, Playmaker!

00:18:06.120 --> 00:18:07.440
Who is that?

00:18:08.280 --> 00:18:11.330
He's clearly you.

00:18:11.330 --> 00:18:13.240
Stop joking.

00:18:13.240 --> 00:18:16.140
You're parasites infesting LINK VRAINS!

00:18:16.140 --> 00:18:18.140
Any of you can challenge me!

00:18:18.140 --> 00:18:19.310
Bring it on!

00:18:19.310 --> 00:18:20.180
You fool!

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:22.380
We got you to show up!

00:18:25.470 --> 00:18:26.790
You puny flies!

00:19:02.040 --> 00:19:06.030
The next time we meet, I’ll 
pummel you in a duel!

00:19:06.030 --> 00:19:09.030
You’re garbage that's not worth dueling!

00:19:09.030 --> 00:19:11.500
Just be happy I fought you!

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:13.980
Nice, Playmaker!

00:19:18.340 --> 00:19:20.800
You’re Playmaker?

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:23.740
You showed up, Dr. Genome!

00:19:26.820 --> 00:19:29.440
Do you know what "genome" means?

00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:35.450
"Genome" is a combination 
of "gene" and "chromosome."

00:19:35.450 --> 00:19:38.290
It's all the genetic information in DNA.

00:19:38.290 --> 00:19:45.360
When I researched it, I realized that the 
arrangement of DNA and programs are similar.

00:19:45.880 --> 00:19:48.140
